    "Coloque aqui melodias em notação ABC (.abc). Cada arquivo vira uma melodia para os instrumentos:\nsegure Shift e clique com o botão direito para escolher, clique com o direito para tocar.\n": "Put melodies in ABC notation (.abc) here. Each file becomes a melody for the instruments:\nhold Shift and right-click to choose, right-click to play.\n",
    "Coloque aqui pacotes de textura (pastas ou arquivos .zip).\nFuncionam pacotes deste jogo (textures/block/NOME.png) e pacotes do Minecraft\n(assets/minecraft/textures/block/...). Escolha o pacote no menu de pausa (Esc).\n\nPut texture packs here (folders or .zip files). Pick one in the pause menu (Esc).\n": "Put texture packs here (folders or .zip files).\nPacks for this game (textures/block/NAME.png) and Minecraft packs\n(assets/minecraft/textures/block/...) both work. Pick the pack in the pause menu (Esc).\n\nPut texture packs here (folders or .zip files). Pick one in the pause menu (Esc).\n",
    "Coloque aqui suas músicas (mp3, ogg, wav ou flac).\nArquivos soltos tocam em qualquer lugar. Para escolher onde tocam, use subpastas:\noverworld, underwater, creative, nether, end, title.\nNo menu de pausa (Esc), mude 'Música' para 'Minha pasta' ou 'Ambas'.\n\nPut your own songs here. In the pause menu set Music to 'Minha pasta' (yours only) or 'Ambas' (both).\n": "Put your songs here (mp3, ogg, wav or flac).\nLoose files play anywhere. To choose where they play, use subfolders:\noverworld, underwater, creative, nether, end, title.\nIn the pause menu (Esc), set 'Music' to 'My folder' or 'Both'.\n\nPut your own songs here. In the pause menu set Music to 'My folder' (yours only) or 'Both' (both).\n",
    "Coloque aqui suas próprias pinturas (arquivos .png).\nO tamanho na parede (1 a 4 blocos de largura e altura) vem do formato da imagem;\ncada bloco usa 16x16 pixels, então 32x16 vira uma pintura de 2x1 blocos.\nNo jogo, mire numa parede e aperte P para escolher a pintura.\n\nPut your own paintings here (.png). Aim at a wall and press P to hang one.\n": "Put your own paintings here (.png files).\nThe size on the wall (1 to 4 blocks wide and tall) comes from the image shape;\neach block uses 16x16 pixels, so 32x16 becomes a 2x1 block painting.\nIn game, aim at a wall and press P to choose the painting.\n\nPut your own paintings here (.png). Aim at a wall and press P to hang one.\n",
    "Coloque pacotes (pasta ou .zip) na pasta acima.": "Put packs (folder or .zip) in the folder above.",
